{
  "dom_id": "step-648008",
  "name": "Finding a Value Given a Ratio",
  "problem": "Now, let's see how we can find a value given the ratio and another value.\n\nSuppose at a school library, there are some science books and $396$ history books. The ratio of the number of science books to the number of history books is $3: 4.$ By rounding the number of history books to the nearest ten, approximate the number of science books in the library.\n\nFirst, let's approximate the number of history books:\n\n$$\n396 \\longrightarrow 400\n$$\n\nThe ratio of the number of science books to the number of history books is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\color{blue}3}{\\color{red}4}.\n$$\n\n  \n\nHere, \n\n- the numerator represents the number of science books, and\n\n- the denominator represents the number of history books.\n\nWe can make a denominator of $400$ by multiplying the numerator and denominator by $100{:}$\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{3 \\times 100}{4 \\times 100} = \\dfrac{300}{400}\n$$\n\nTherefore, there are approximately $300$ science books in the library.",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-648008\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"648008\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"14923\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-648008\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-9\">Finding a Value Given a Ratio</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"648008\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-tran